// Training-query hits beyond the concept line enter the hybrid score
// only when the pairs file supplies the weight.
// An explicit weight stays on the concept line alone.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE label ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG label rank

IMPULSE label 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "label" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
